      "blocks": {
        "item_WaPpKd": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can 82X Support My Weight Management and Skin Goals Simultaneously?",
            "content": "<p>Yes — and that's exactly what makes the Sakura line unique. Most beauty supplements target only skin. Ours combines 120,000mg of deep-sea salmon collagen and Sakura Extract for visible skin renewal with African Mango Seed Extract and Yeast Peptide for fat metabolism and appetite control. You support both goals in a single 500ml daily bottle.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
        "item_wGGX4D": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why Is This Formula Superior to Regular Collagen Drinks?",
            "content": "<p>Our Liposomal technology protects Kosoteki peptides (under 500 Daltons) for enhanced bio-availability and deeper skin support.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "item_QUdkMG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I’m Over 35 with Visible Aging Concerns. Is This Right for Me?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Formulated for women 30+, it supports skin density and resilience to help smooth the appearance of fine lines and lift from within.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "item_FwXRPR": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is It Safe for Consistent Daily Use?",
            "content": "<p>Our formula is crafted from premium botanical and marine ingredients. It is designed for long-term support as part of a balanced lifestyle. As with any supplement, we recommend consulting your physician if you are pregnant, nursing, or managing a medical condition.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        }
      },
